<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>2022-12 on</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/tags/2022-12/</link><description>Recent content in 2022-12 on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yshghid.github.io/tags/2022-12/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>올겨울 최애 간식</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog25/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog25/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="올겨울-최애-간식"&gt;&#10; 올겨울 최애 간식&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%98%ac%ea%b2%a8%ec%9a%b8-%ec%b5%9c%ec%95%a0-%ea%b0%84%ec%8b%9d"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2022. 12. 26. 22:44&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="828" height="1149" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/58effe2a-c8df-49bb-8114-1f8d41898190" /&gt;&#10;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;누룽지 뽀글이&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;아침에 나가야할때 하나돌려먹고 가면 그렇게 든든할수가없음 ㅋㅋ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="828" height="1093" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4e5c959-cff9-49df-a98c-4452d36bbc11" /&gt;&#10;&lt;ol start="2"&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;쿠크다스 폴바셋 에디션&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;공부할때 하나 까먹기 좋다.&#10;커피랑도 잘어울리고, 남은 요거트랑 먹어도 맛있음.&#10;라떼랑 먹는게 최고일듯&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="828" height="1130" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ccf62c5b-15eb-4755-8c9b-32fbf7dcc8d9" /&gt;&#10;&lt;ol start="3"&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;리얼 그래놀라 오리지널&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;지금껏 수많은 종류의 시리얼을 먹어봣지만&amp;hellip;. 얘만큼 질리지않고 맛있는 시리얼은 보지 못했다. 근본 시리얼임 ㅋ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="828" height="1165" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b49a6a5-20c2-46ee-8742-cff68f822ae2" /&gt;&#10;&lt;ol start="4"&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;오! 그래놀라 다이제&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;리얼 그래놀라만 미친듯이 먹다가, 왠지 맛있을것같아서 샀는데 이것도 ㄹㅇ 맛있음. 다만 좀 달아서 1봉 다먹으면 당분간 생각 안나고, 한두달 지나고 사먹으면 또 맛남 ㅋㅋ&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>11-12월 이제는한파다</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog24/</link><pubDate>Sat, 03 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog24/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="11-12월-이제는한파다"&gt;&#10; 11-12월 이제는한파다&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#11-12%ec%9b%94-%ec%9d%b4%ec%a0%9c%eb%8a%94%ed%95%9c%ed%8c%8c%eb%8b%a4"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2022. 12. 3. 23:01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb518075-e3fc-4a66-b83c-ec08523f7328" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;졸논 발표는 진짜급하게만들었는데 매우 쓰레기같은 발표였지만 다른사람들도 쓰레기처럼해와서 인지를제대로못하게 만드네 사람이.. ㅋㅋ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="706" height="1280" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/26fee890-3033-4859-8ad7-a8b2f23b630f" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;ㅋㅋㅋ 이거 어디서 주워왔지??&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이거 보고 나도 논문서론을 이런식으로..! ㅇㅈㄹ 했던듯 ㅋㅋ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;현실은 존나 대충씀 ㅜ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="960" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f958d691-db51-406c-9577-f4ab98cdebe4" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;하루필름 증명사진 시도했으나&amp;hellip; fail&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이날 증명사진 찍고 스타벅스가서 있다가 동노 가서 노래도 부르고 4시에 맞춰서 설렁설렁 연구실 갔더니 무슨 미팅하고있어서 6시넘게까지 있었다. 난사실 좋았다 거기있는것만으로도좋음 소속감 들어서&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="2275" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2fc2a72-c7da-457e-8944-fc8c9f42247b" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;바삐 논문을쓰던 어느 건강한날..!&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>